  "name": "Application Mapping: DIO Reconstruction Failure Modes × RAG Pipeline",
  "description": "A derived diagnostic mapping from DIO Reconstruction Failure Modes to generic retrieval-augmented generation pipeline loci, mechanisms, observable symptoms, and hypothetical incidents, with a live dated extension on iterative and hypothesis-conditioned evidence acquisition.",
